    <td style="width: 0.25in">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">&#9679;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">meeting to review and discuss PubCo&#8217;s annual audited financial statements and quarterly financial statements with PubCo&#8217;s management and the independent auditor, including reviewing PubCo&#8217;s specific disclosures under &#8220;Management&#8217;s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations&#8221;&#894;</td> </tr>
  </table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="width: 0.25in">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">&#9679;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">reviewing and approving any related party transaction required to be disclosed pursuant to Item 404 of Regulation S-K promulgated by the Securities and Exchange Commission (&#8220;<b>SEC</b>&#8221;) prior to PubCo entering into such transaction; and</td> </tr>
  </table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

