  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="width: 0.25in">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">&#9679;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">reviewing and approving on an annual basis the corporate goals and objectives relevant to PubCo&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer&#8217;s compensation and evaluating PubCo&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer&#8217;s performance in light of such goals and objectives and determining and approving the remuneration of PubCo&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer based on such evaluation;</td> </tr>
  </table>

