  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="width: 0.25in">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">&#9679;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">reviewing and making recommendations to the PubCo Board with respect to compensation and any incentive compensation and equity-based plans that are subject to board approval of all of PubCo&#8217;s other officers;</td> </tr>
  </table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="width: 0.25in">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">&#9679;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">reviewing PubCo&#8217;s executive compensation policies and plans;</td> </tr>
  </table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>



