<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0">On the Closing Date, PubCo filed an Amended and Restated Certificate of Incorporation with the Secretary of State of Delaware and adopted new Bylaws in connection with the Business Combination. Copies of the Amended and Restated Certificate of Incorporation and Bylaws are filed as Exhibits 3.1 and 3.2 to this Current Report on Form 8-K, respectively, and are incorporated herein by reference.</p>

